---@field path? string Path to access on the HTTP server.
---@field port number Name or number of the port to access on the container. Number must be in the range 1 to 65535. Name must be an IANA_SVC_NAME.
---@field scheme? azure.app.Scheme|string Scheme to use for connecting to the host. Defaults to HTTP.

